# A document another Quill window has open with changes asks before it opens here; Yes opens it and this window then writes no recovery copy for it.
@recovery
@alive "C:\\DOCS\\LETTER.QLD"
@file "C:\\DOCS\\LETTER.QLD" "dear sir"
cmd Open
choose "C:\\DOCS\\LETTER.QLD"
expect recover "LETTER.QLD is open in another Quill window. Open it here as well? Changes made here are not autosaved." buttons=YesNo default No
answer no
dump
cmd Open
expect file Open
choose "C:\\DOCS\\LETTER.QLD"
expect recover buttons=YesNo
answer yes
type ", and madam"
autosave
dump
